.Dd 2025-09-30
.Dt OPENSSL-DGST 1ossl
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm openssl-dgst
.Nd perform digest operations
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm openssl
.Ar dgst Ns | Ns Em digest
.Oo
